Hi {Owner},

I build websites for kitchen and bath remodelers around {City}. {Business Name} has strong finished rooms on its social pages, but no site a homeowner finds when they search what a remodel costs.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: kitchens and baths sorted by room, a budget-range page in your words, and a week-by-week timeline of a typical remodel, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
